  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The Republic of Moldova is currently facing a pressing development challenge characterized by an energy crisis and soaring energy prices. This crisis has had severe consequences, including high inflation, potential recession, and a significant decline in GDP. Moldovan households, particularly those in rural areas, women, and people with disabilities, have been disproportionately affected by energy poverty, with a substantial portion of their income dedicated to energy expenses. In response to th</narrative>
  </description>
