   <indicator aggregation-status="1" ascending="0" measure="1">
    <title>
     <narrative xml:lang="EN">Reduction of carbon emissions and enhanced sustainability in various economic sectors (non-energy) including businesses through the widespread adoption of low-carbon technologies and practices, leading to a greener and more climate-resilient economy.</narrative>
